00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:20.530
when I wasn't that drunk yet.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.195
After one shot, I would just get red.

00:00:22.195 --> 00:00:24.148
- Within like few
minutes, I turn beet red.

00:00:24.148 --> 00:00:26.337
- Normally, I turn
maroon, like a love seat.

00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:27.558
