00:00:27.558 --> 00:00:28.898
When you go to the bathroom and you look

00:00:28.898 --> 00:00:30.153
in the mirror and you're like, "whoa"

00:00:30.153 --> 00:00:31.481
- My face gets puffy.

00:00:31.481 --> 00:00:33.676
- My whole body swells,
pounding headaches,

00:00:33.676 --> 00:00:36.114
blurred vision, whole
list of side-effects.

00:00:36.114 --> 00:00:37.210
That happen when I'm drunk.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:39.720
- I'll start feeling like,
really heavy in my shoulders,

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.553
I've never gotten a hangover the next day.

00:00:41.553 --> 00:00:42.651
- Yeah.
- I get it the night of.

00:00:42.651 --> 00:00:44.640
- It's gotten worse as I've gotten older.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.020
