said you can take Pepcid

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.256
to prevent it, so I started doing that.

00:00:53.256 --> 00:00:54.636
90 percent of the time, it works.

00:00:54.636 --> 00:00:56.659
- I actually have a bottle
of Pepcid in my car,

00:00:56.659 --> 00:00:59.464
at my desk, at home, in the nightstand.

00:00:59.464 --> 00:01:01.181
With Pepcid, you get slightly pink,

00:01:01.181 --> 00:01:02.805
but not like crazy red.

00:01:02.805 --> 00:01:05.159
- My regimen, two Xantax
and then I take a Claritin,

00:01:05.159 --> 00:01:06.502
and then I'll get like a burger.

00:01:06.502 --> 00:01:07.760
I'm armed with eyedrops.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.155
